<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5228" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμεύομαι</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμείβομαι</span>
			, only fut. and aor. 1, <i>surpass,
				outstrip,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμεύσασθ᾽ ἀντίους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					1.45
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμεύσεσθε Τίσανδρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					23
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>pass over,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδατα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Euph.
					119
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>purchase</i>(?), <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				4964
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Gortyn</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
